Details:
Outside the reference axis and within the angular fields defined in the diagrams in annex 1 to this Regulation, the intensity of the light emitted by each of the two devices supplied must:
In each direction corresponding to the points in the light distribution table reproduced in annex 4 to this Regulation, be not less than the product of the minimum specified in paragraph 6.1 above by the percentage specified in the said table for the direction in question;
In no direction within the space from which the light-signalling device is visible, exceed the maximum specified in paragraph 6.1 above;
